    "title": "St. Ambrose-See in her the pattern of your life, …",
    "text": "St. Ambrose—See in her the pattern of your life, …\nSee in her the pattern of your life, for in her, as though in a model, manifest teachings of goodness show what you should correct, what you should copy, and what preserve. … For such was Mary that her life alone suffices for the instruction of all.\n— St. Ambrose",
